</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="mi">2018</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">11</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">07</span><span class="n">T16</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="mi">51</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="mf">30.913</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">0800</span> <span class="n">E</span> <span class="n">STORAGE</span>  <span class="p">[</span><span class="n">WTCheckpointThread</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="n">WiredTiger</span> <span class="n">error</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">28</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="err">：</span><span class="n">handle</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">write</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">pwrite</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">failed</span> <span class="n">to</span> <span class="n">write</span> <span class="mi">4096</span> <span class="n">bytes</span> <span class="n">at</span> <span class="n">offset</span> <span class="mi">1486848</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">No</span> <span class="n">space</span> <span class="n">left</span> <span class="n">on</span> <span class="n">device</span>
